practices generally accepted in India along with the circulars, guidelines and directions issued by the Reserve Bank of India (hereinafter referred to as "the RBI") from time to time. These standalone financial results have been reviewed and recommended by the Audit Committee in its meeting held on July 16, 2026 and approved by the Board of Directors in their meeting held on the same date. These financial results are available on the website of the Company viz. https://www.jfs.in and on the website of BSE Limited ("BSE") (www.bseindia.com) and National Stock Exchange of India Limited ("NSE") (www.nseindia.com). &lt;br /&gt; 
